    <CHAPTER cnumber="16">
      <VERS vnumber="1"> The <gr str="4633">preparations </gr>of the <gr str="3820">heart </gr>in <gr str="120">man</gr>, and the <gr str="4617">answer </gr>of the <gr str="3956">tongue</gr>, <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> is </STYLE> from the <gr str="4480 3068">LORD</gr>. </VERS>
