      <VERS vnumber="31"> The <gr str="7872">hoary </gr>head <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> is </STYLE> a <gr str="5850">crown </gr>of <gr str="8597">glory</gr>, <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> if </STYLE> it be <gr str="4672">found </gr>in the <gr str="1870">way </gr>of <gr str="6666">righteousness</gr>. </VERS>
